  "claim_scope": "For every actual cofinal admission ordinal, original packetAt generates its grade/full frame/sourceSeed/cfg/LowVar equality. StockAdmission.presentation uses the original StockObservation root/visit definitionally. actual_index recognizes this same root current at the complete sealed runtime state, so the existing installed stock raw restriction and entire native MaterialAt including state/Trace/owner transport to that exact occurrence. readRaw returns original registered Env/AST; requestAtStop uses same material raw/Env/owner. The existing FourFace source relation and cochain differential then consume the installed AST, and existing CompleteWordDual recovers every literal coefficient word and actual installed relation boundary. No NativeSegmentAt or supplied future family is input.",
  "certified_machine_facts": [
    "Both new production modules freshly pass focused trust0/werror in the independent clean library; both main OLeans are byte-identical to frozen exports. Construction outputs supply only comparison hashes, never dependency/kernel evidence.",
    "All 15 exact original new controls and 14 printed mouths pass. Lean confirms controls 1/2/4/6/8/15 are non-Prop definitions, the remaining 9 are theorems, and control 15 preserves arbitrary Result : Sort v.",
    "Original CP115InstalledRaw, CP106AdmissionStops and CP110InquiryDiagram gates freshly pass, retaining actual source-write 1/0 installed read/coimage controls, paid-not-settled and scalar-erasure/distinct occurrence/full-field nonzero contracts.",
    "For every cofinal ordinal, original Admissions.packetAt generates its complete grade/frame/sourceSeed/cfg/LowVar equality. Original actual_index and admission-current rfl recognize this same full packet at original sealed runtime.stateAt(index). No NativeSegmentAt or completed future table is a source input.",
    "One actual current equality transports existing installed stock raw restriction and entire source-native MaterialAt to the exact cofinal stop emitted occurrence. Material source theorem preserves original Env/raw, full state/Trace HEq and original source-owner HEq; typed request copies those exact fields.",
    "Installed project Env/AST agree with that request. Original FourFace source_boundary/generated_differential consume installed AST and full paid endpoint, with no target commuting certificate supplied.",
    "Existing whole combinatorial face retains exact full local native Trace. Existing CompleteWordDual recovers every arbitrary literal coefficient word at that grade and the actual installed relation boundary.",
    "Independent Result : Sort v handler receives source-generated restriction/material, source state/owner HEq, installed request equality, actual differential and complete relation inverse directly from the original packet producer.",
    "Complete new type/value provenance covers 12441 logical declarations and 77 target paths, including generic private readout/transporters. Only standard three axioms; no unsafe/partial/unresolved declarations.",
    "All 1386 nonowned source snapshots match tracked HEAD with zero delta. OLean/sidecar reuse comes solely from recursive source/import/compiler/signature-matched formally certified CP115 evidence, with zero construction-artifact reuse."
